     "\r<br>\r<br>On Fri, Feb 28, 2014 at 1:59 PM,  &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hakd...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:\r<br>&gt; Hi all,\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; I would like to check if a textInput has been completed, and then run an\r<br>&gt; operation based on this. For some reason, the following simplified code does\r<br>&gt; not work. Is there something wrong (sorry for my ignorance) ?\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; library(shiny)\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; ui &lt;- pageWithSidebar(\r<br>&gt; headerPanel(&quot;TEST&quot;),\r<br>&gt; sidebarPanel(\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; textInput(&#39;C1&#39;, &quot;&quot;,&quot;C1&quot;)\r<br>&gt; ),\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; mainPanel(uiOutput(&quot;value&quot;))\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; )\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; server &lt;- function(input,output){\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; output$value &lt;- renderUI({\r<br>&gt; #input$C1\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; if (is.null(input$C1)){\r<br>&gt; value &lt;- 0}\r<br>&gt; else{\r<br>&gt; value &lt;- 1\r<br>&gt; }\r<br>&gt; })\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; }\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; runApp(list(ui=ui,server=server))\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; Any suggestion highly appreciated.\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; Cheers\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; PS: I&#39;ve also posted the questions on\r<br>&gt; <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/22104648/r-shiny-how-to-make-an-operation-based-on-textinput\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/22104648/r-shiny-how-to-make-an-operation-based-on-textinput&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404612320000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DxnVm-temTQEL4js3vnfq\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/22104648/r-shiny-how-to-make-an-operation-based-on-textinput</a>\r<br>"
